[DOCUMENT]
TITLE: Heracles Software Design Document for External GUI
UID: DHF-HRC-0042
METADATA:
  COMPONENT: heracles-external-gui

[GRAMMAR]
IMPORT_FROM_FILE: @grammar

[[SECTION]]
TITLE: Purpose

[TEXT]
STATEMENT: >>>
The purpose of this document is to outline the design specifications of the Heracles External GUI Software.
<<<

[[/SECTION]]

[[SECTION]]
TITLE: Scope

[TEXT]
STATEMENT: >>>
This document describes the design modules and sub-modules of the Heracles External GUI Software. The information in this document is derived from the External GUI SRS, referenced in this document.

\*The term Software applies to both Software and Firmware components.
<<<

[[/SECTION]]

[[SECTION]]
TITLE: Abbreviations and Definitions

[TEXT]
STATEMENT: >>>
FW
Firmware

MCU
Microcontroller Unit

PRS
Product Requirements Specification

SDP
Software Development Plan

SRS
Software Requirements Specification

SW
Software
<<<

[[/SECTION]]

[[SECTION]]
TITLE: Overview

[TEXT]
STATEMENT: >>>
The external GUI console provides a means for the user to activate and monitor the treatment. It communicates with the main control board and treatment head camera.

The external GUI software runs on the external tablet console located outside the room.
<<<

