[DESIGN_ITEM]
UID: SW-H10TG-278
TITLE: Play sound during emission
STATEMENT: >>>
The flow for providing audible indication during active emission should be implemented as described in the following sequence diagram:

.. raw:: html

    <pre class="mermaid">
    sequenceDiagram
        box Application
            participant MainView
            participant Converter as GcbStatusToRadiation<br/>HazardActiveStateConverter
            participant GCBDataStore
        end
        box Control Board
            participant Firmware
        end

        [?] ->> MainView: OnLoad
        activate MainView
        
        MainView->>GCBDataStore: getSystemTelemetry
        activate GCBDataStore
        
        activate Firmware
        Firmware-->>GCBDataStore: OnTelemetryChanged
        deactivate Firmware
        
        GCBDataStore-->>MainView: return SystemTelemetry
        deactivate GCBDataStore

        MainView->>Converter: convert
        activate Converter
        Converter->>Converter: if emission return else return false
        activate Converter
        deactivate Converter
        Converter->>MainView: return state
        deactivate Converter

        MainView->>MainView: ChangeRadiationIconColor(state)
        activate MainView
        deactivate MainView
        
        MainView->>MainView: PlaySound(state)
        activate MainView
        deactivate MainView
        
        deactivate MainView
    </pre>
