[DESIGN_ITEM]
UID: SW-H10TG-33
TITLE: Radiation Emission View - Treatment Plan Staging Operational Point Parameters
STATEMENT: >>>
The application shall initiate a new firmware session with an argument-free staging
request, then send the parameters for exactly one scalar emission.

The scalar emission includes acceleration potential, emission current, delivery time,
remaining time, focus and deflection adjustments, and filament current. Each value must be
within its configured operating range.
