[DESIGN_ITEM]
UID: SW-H10TG-254
TITLE: Treatment Fields Emission Progress indicators
STATEMENT: >>>
Emission progress consumes immutable semantic snapshots published from unsolicited
telemetry. The application-owned ActiveEmissionIndex identifies the current business field;
the firmware telemetry contains no point index or point count. During emission, scalar
timer values determine emission progress; during launching, the heater-current setpoint
determines launching progress.

.. raw:: html

    <pre class="mermaid">
    sequenceDiagram
        participant VM as OperatePlanViewModelBase
        participant CC as CollimatorControl
        participant TFL as TreatmentFieldList
        participant EP as EmissionProgress
        participant DS as GCBDataStore

        DS-->>VM: SystemTelemetryChanged(immutable snapshot)
        VM->>VM: Read application-owned ActiveEmissionIndex
        VM->>CC: Keep prepared field selection
        VM->>TFL: Keep prepared field selection
        alt Emission state
            VM->>VM: Calculate emission progress from timers
            VM->>EP: Set emission progress
        else Launching state
            VM->>VM: Calculate launching progress from heater setpoint
            VM->>EP: Set launching progress
        end
    </pre>
<<<
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: RQ-H10TG-4
  ROLE: Refines
